      "text" : "with energy..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 314,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "[The Book of Ymir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "And their souls will be given abilities with the heart of Ymir. However, the heart of Ymir was totally destroyed and scattered all over the world after the battle for Rune-Midgarts."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 317,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "[The Book of Ymir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "I have found a small amount of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "Ymir heart pieces over a long"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "long period of time. But I can't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 321,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "confirm if the story of Valkyrie"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "and Valhalla is true just"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "through scientific tests."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "[The Book of Ymir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "So, I am leaving this record in hope that someone in the future"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "can confirm that Valkyrie and Valhalla actually exist..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "[The Book of Ymir]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Book of Ymir",
      "text" : "Let the heroes live new lives"
    },
